sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Store Manager
  actor D as Delivery Agent
  participant Adm as Admin Dashboard
  participant API as API (Laravel)
  participant Ord as Order Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Queue Worker
  participant FCM as Push (FCM)
  actor C as Customer

  M->>Adm: Open new orders queue
  Adm->>API: GET /admin/orders?status=PENDING
  API->>DB: SELECT orders
  DB-->>API: orders list
  API-->>Adm: Render orders
  M->>Adm: Confirm order -> CONFIRMED
  Adm->>API: PATCH /orders/{id} {status: CONFIRMED}
  API->>Ord: Update status + assign delivery
  Ord->>DB: UPDATE order, INSERT delivery
  API->>Q: OrderStatusChanged job
  Q->>FCM: Push "Order confirmed"
  FCM-->>C: Notification
  D->>API: PATCH /deliveries/{id} {status: OUT_FOR_DELIVERY}
  API->>DB: UPDATE delivery + order
  API->>Q: OrderStatusChanged job
  Q->>FCM: Push "Out for delivery"
  FCM-->>C: Notification
  C->>API: GET /orders/{id}/track
  API->>DB: SELECT order + delivery status
  DB-->>API: timeline
  API-->>C: Live status timeline
  D->>API: PATCH /deliveries/{id} {status: DELIVERED}
  API->>DB: UPDATE delivery, order=DELIVERED, payment=PAID
